TEXT 32 24 Left 3 ;#224 Gilbert cell AM modulation
TEXT 32 72 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=38OQub2Vi2Q
TEXT 32 112 Left 2 ;Adjusting the lower-pair DC bias retains the carrier (AM) or balances it away (DSB-SC).
TEXT 32 1248 Left 2 ;18 kHz carrier, 1.5 kHz modulation and 50 mVpp drives follow Alan's notes.
TEXT 32 1288 Left 2 ;VBIAS is a simulation setting: Alan does not state his bench supply voltage.
TEXT 32 1336 Left 2 !.param VBIAS=2.82
TEXT 32 1376 Left 2 !.tran 0 20m 0 1u
TEXT 32 1416 Left 2 !.four 1.5k 13 15 V(COL_A,COL_B)
TEXT 760 1336 Left 2 !.meas tran ENV_MAX MAX V(COL_A,COL_B) FROM 10m TO 20m
TEXT 760 1376 Left 2 !.meas tran ENV_MIN MIN V(COL_A,COL_B) FROM 10m TO 20m
TEXT 760 1416 Left 2 !.meas tran LPAIR_MAX MAX V(L_SIG,L_REF) FROM 10m TO 20m
TEXT 760 1456 Left 2 !.meas tran LPAIR_MIN MIN V(L_SIG,L_REF) FROM 10m TO 20m
